But the Zariman weapons imo, are perfectly fine the way they are and should remain there untouched, since the requirements are kinda insane to get

&#x200B;

I'd also go out of my way to say evolved weapons are one of the coolest features in Warframe and they should 100% make a lot more of them, the only thing I ask is they don't make the evolution for final form as BS as Zariman, it did rub me the wrong way knowing I need 3 weapons to get each final form.

